WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:15.294
Danny: We should have brought the shrink-gun.

2
00:00:15.295 --> 00:00:17.800
We could zap them right now.

3
00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:21.618
Brad: Danny, we can't do it with people around!

4
00:00:21.619 --> 00:00:23.092
Danny: Are you kidding?

5
00:00:23.093 --> 00:00:25.004
We would be heroes!

6
00:00:25.005 --> 00:00:28.429
Danny: It would be like we were back in Ginormous!

7
00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:31.100
Brad: What do you mean?

8
00:00:31.101 --> 00:00:32.543
Danny: Think about it!

9
00:00:32.544 --> 00:00:37.661
Danny: After we shrank them, we could keep Chuck and Dave in glass jars.

10
00:00:37.662 --> 00:00:40.344
Danny: All the other kids would rejoice.

11
00:00:40.345 --> 00:00:46.846
Danny: They would lift us onto their shoulders, and there would [n3@be a parade and a big feast!

12
00:00:46.847 --> 00:00:50.366
Brad: Umm, Danny. Do you see him?

13
00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:52.992
Danny: You mean, Mr. Smith?

14
00:00:52.993 --> 00:00:56.975
Brad: He might not celebrate if we shrunk the bullies.

15
00:00:56.976 --> 00:00:59.012
Danny: I suppose.

16
00:00:59.013 --> 00:01:00.759
Brad: We need a plan.

17
00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.692
Danny: You're good at plans.

18
00:01:02.693 --> 00:01:04.466
Have you got one?

19
00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:11.934
Brad: Well, we need to find a way to get them alone.

20
00:01:11.935 --> 00:01:16.106
Danny: Right. But we don't want them to suspect anything.

21
00:01:16.107 --> 00:01:21.058
Brad: Hmm. If we could get them to follow us . . .

22
00:01:21.059 --> 00:01:26.625
Danny: Do you have an idea?

23
00:01:26.626 --> 00:01:29.420
Danny: Ha-ha! You're a genius!

24
00:01:29.421 --> 00:01:32.728
Brad: Well, I have my moments of brilliance.

25
00:01:32.729 --> 00:01:36.850
Tina: Hi.

26
00:01:36.851 --> 00:01:38.571
Brad: Hi, Tina.

27
00:01:38.572 --> 00:01:40.720
Danny: Tina? Who's Tina?

28
00:01:40.721 --> 00:01:42.859
I don't think I know her.

29
00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:44.799
Tina: Danny.

30
00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:46.877
Danny: Do you hear something?

31
00:01:46.878 --> 00:01:50.503
Tina: I just came to say that I hope you change your minds.

32
00:01:50.504 --> 00:01:51.919
Brad: Okay.

33
00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:55.449
Tina: Becoming a bully isn't the way to deal with bullies.

34
00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:57.494
Brad: Okay.

35
00:01:57.495 --> 00:02:00.539
Tina: Danny, aren't you going to say anything?

36
00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:04.666
Danny: Brad, there's an annoying buzzing sound, like a pest.

37
00:02:04.667 --> 00:02:07.422
Tina: Hopian would be ashamed of you.

38
00:02:07.423 --> 00:02:10.328
Danny: Don't say that about Hopian!

39
00:02:10.329 --> 00:02:11.852
I saved him!

40
00:02:11.853 --> 00:02:15.129
He's my friend.

41
00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:16.943
Tina: I'm sorry, Danny.

42
00:02:16.944 --> 00:02:20.811
I think Hopian would say the same thing I'm saying.

43
00:02:20.812 --> 00:02:23.598
Brad: Danny, stop it.

44
00:02:23.599 --> 00:02:26.710
Danny: I never want to see you again!

45
00:02:26.711 --> 00:02:32.784
Tina: We'll see about that.

46
00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:37.252
Chuck: Ha-ha! What do you think happened here?

47
00:02:37.253 --> 00:02:41.951
Dave: I think the boyfriend and girlfriend had a fight.

48
00:02:41.952 --> 00:02:44.772
Danny: She's not my girlfriend!

49
00:02:44.773 --> 00:02:49.279
Chuck: She broke his heart!

50
00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:51.659
Brad: You two should watch out.

51
00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:54.206
Chuck: What are you talking about?

52
00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:58.118
Brad: I don't think you want to make us mad.

53
00:02:58.119 --> 00:03:03.897
Dave: Oh no?
